  "id": "BIT-grafana-2026-92539",
  "summary": "Cross-organization user modification and deletion via the SCIM API in Grafana Enterprise",
  "details": "A service account with user-management permissions in one organization can read, modify, disable or delete users belonging to other organizations on the same Grafana instance through the SCIM API (insecure direct object reference). Only Grafana Enterprise instances with SCIM enabled are affected.",
